## Executive Summary

Nemotron 3.5 Super VL is NVIDIA's flagship vision-capable general-purpose model from the Nemotron 3.5 series, released in 2026, designed for complex reasoning, coding, and knowledge work with image understanding capabilities. It features competitive pricing and strong performance across agentic benchmarks with optimized speed and extended context capabilities. The model ranks 89th overall with a score of 83.3/100, indicating strong performance in the frontier model landscape. Nemotron 3.5 Super VL is part of the Nemotron 3.5 series alongside Nemotron 3.5, Nemotron 3.5-Pro, and Nemotron 3.5-Vision, offering different capabilities and pricing tiers.

